$0(){return this.a.XZ(this.b,"Privacy Policy","SmartCalc AI \u2014 Privacy Policy (effective July 2026)\n\n1. OFFLINE-FIRST BY DESIGN\nSmartCalc AI is designed to work completely without an internet connection. All calculations, history, favorites, preferences and personalization learning are stored exclusively on your device in the app's private storage.\n\n2. DATA WE DO NOT COLLECT\nWe do not collect, transmit, sell or share: names, contacts, location, device identifiers, usage content, or any calculation inputs. The app requests no unnecessary permissions.\n\n3. OPTIONAL FEATURES\nIf you enable optional future cloud backup, only the backup snapshot you explicitly export will leave your device, encrypted in transit. Analytics and crash reporting are disabled by default and can be turned off anytime in Admin \u2192 Flags.\n\n4. ADVERTISING\nIf ads are enabled, they appear only on the home dashboard's reserved banner area \u2014 never on calculator screens, and we never use deceptive placements. Ad preferences comply with Google Play Families and AdMob policies. GDPR consent is collected where required.\n\n5. CHILDREN\nThe app is suitable for all audiences (COPPA-conscious). No personal data of children is knowingly collected.\n\n6. YOUR RIGHTS\nAll your data stays on your device and can be fully exported or deleted at any time (You \u2192 Backup / Clear data). Account deletion = uninstall; nothing remains on our side because nothing was ever transmitted.\n\n7. CONTACT\nsupport@smartcalc.ai\n")},
